Package: restaurabee
Type: Package
Title: Prioritization of Plant Species for Ecological Restoration Using Plant-Pollinator Interaction Networks
Version: 0.1.0
Authors@R:
    person(
        given = "Emerson",
        family = "Dechechi Chambó",
        email = "chamboed@ufrb.edu.br",
        role = c("aut", "cre"),
        comment = c(ORCID = "0000-0003-3507-3106")
    )
Description: Provides a workflow for prioritizing plant species for
    ecological restoration based on plant-pollinator interaction networks.
    The package calculates the Interaction Importance Index (IIP), species
    specialization (d'), the Interaction-based Restoration Priority Index
    (IPR), sensitivity analyses, and network-level metrics to support
    evidence-based restoration planning.
